{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":[["#","^speaker: ???","/#","^Oh.","\n","^Good. You’re still here.","\n","^I was worried I’d be too late.","\n","^You’re the gravekeeper, yes?","\n","ev","str","^Who are you?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^The graveyard is closed.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"sister_intro"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"player_mean"},1,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"player_mean","re":true},{"->":"sister_closed"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"sister_intro":[["#","^speaker: Maribel","/#","^My name is Maribel.","\n","^I’m looking for someone who came through here earlier.","\n","^A woman named Tabitha.","\n","^Thin. Quiet. Thinks she knows how the dead work.","\n","^She’s my sister.","\n","ev","str","^She was here earlier.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^No one like that came by.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"sister_after_tabitha"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"sister_no_tabitha"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"sister_closed":[["#","^speaker: Maribel","/#","^Closed.","\n","^Yes, I heard that already.","\n","^But you see, I’m not here for the graveyard.","\n","^I’m here because my sister has a habit of interfering with things she doesn’t understand.","\n","^And this place?","\n","^It attracts those things.","\n","ev","str","^Interfering how?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^I still can’t let you in.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"player_scared"},1,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"player_scared","re":true},{"->":"sister_explain"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"sister_request"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"sister_after_tabitha":[["#","^speaker: Maribel","/#","^I knew it.","\n","^She never could resist places like this.","\n","^Always trying to “fix” things.","\n","^Always making them worse.","\n","^If she performed her little rites here, then something of mine is now trapped inside.","\n","^That’s why I need to enter.